      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: size and Referencen Images",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "MiniMax H3 Image doesn't work well in low resolution, so this workflow upscale the input image to 4MP at first.\n\n## Recommended sizes (16MP)\n\nThe effective working range of MiniMax-H3-Image is about 4 MP to 20 MP, and it generally gives\nthe best results at around 16 MP. Common 16 MP sizes are listed below:\n\n| Aspect ratio | Size (width x height) |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:1 | 4096x4096 |\n| 4:3 / 3:4 | 4736x3552 / 3552x4736 |\n| 3:2 / 2:3 | 5024x3360 / 3360x5024 |\n| 16:9 / 9:16 | 5472x3072 / 3072x5472 |\n| 21:9 | 6272x2688 |\n\n## Multiple image editing\n\nIf you want to use multiple image editing:\n- add extra `Load Image` nodes\n- plug the output to both `Generate Text` 👇 and `MiniMax H3 Image Conditioning`👆 nodes"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "MiniMax H3 Image doesn't work well in low resolution, so this workflow upscale the input image to 4MP at first.\n\n## Recommended sizes (16MP)\n\nThe effective working range of MiniMax-H3-Image is about 4 MP to 20 MP, and it generally gives\nthe best results at around 16 MP. Common 16 MP sizes are listed below:\n\n| Aspect ratio | Size (width x height) |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:1 | 4096x4096 |\n| 4:3 / 3:4 | 4736x3552 / 3552x4736 |\n| 3:2 / 2:3 | 5024x3360 / 3360x5024 |\n| 16:9 / 9:16 | 5472x3072 / 3072x5472 |\n| 21:9 | 6272x2688 |\n\n## Multiple image editing\n\nIf you want to use multiple image editing:\n- add extra `Load Image` nodes\n- plug the output to both `Generate Text` 👇 and `MiniMax H3 Image Conditioning`👆 nodes"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
